闲", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199708379610/", "num_games_owned": 62, "num_reviews": 1, "playtime_forever": 9008, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 7269, "last_played": 1777260285, "avatar": "d769058102299b7de0c96725f012ccacec4cf8c6"}, "language": "schinese", "review": "在现实里我没什么朋友，被背叛的感情让我几次想要离开，\r\n在我绝望时，遇到了这款游戏\r\n在这部游戏里\r\n你会遇到伴你始终，任劳任怨的莫利，而且你的每一声呼唤，博斯克都不会让它沉寂\r\n而站在朵朵上，你只需要保驾护航，剩下的完全可以相信无敌的朵，它会把你带到目的地，从来如此\r\n除此之外，你还会交到许多矿友，他们或许离你不过数里，或许在异国他乡\r\n但相同的是，他们是一群值得信赖，有趣的人，他们的陪伴使我坚持，带给我快乐\r\n只要你想，我们有在山洞中的星海，我们有让你显卡爆炸的熔岩喷发，有朋友陪你探索每一个未知的星球\r\n或许有人说，这些终究代替不了现实，确实如此，或许我们家境不同，我没见过火山，也因为光污染没见过星海\r\n但我的朋友，在这里可以看见，虽是虚构物，不比浮尘淡\r\n我的朋友，深岩银河永远欢迎你\r\n", "timestamp_created": 1727713913, "timestamp_updated": 1727713913, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1519804887", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "176100153", "author": {"steamid": "76561198284838282", "personaname": "Don't name too long like me", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198284838282/", "num_games_owned": 115, "num_reviews": 16, "playtime_forever": 8246, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1015, "last_played": 1739376465, "avatar": "1c16b7929f4e40ade474eac7a41ad2eaefddd6d7"}, "language": "schinese", "review": "枪手杀最少怎么办", "timestamp_created": 1727713869, "timestamp_updated": 1727713869, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 2, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1519804887", "reactions": [{"reaction_type": 13, "count": 1}]}, {"recommendationid": "176099690", "author": {"ste